hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1799","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi hisaab nahi liya jaata magar halaak hota hai. Aur baaqi hadees Ilm ki kitaab mein guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 4939). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Tum zaroor haal se haal par sawaar hogey)."
"1800","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: (Tum zaroor haal se haal par sawaar hogey) haal key baad haal. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye tumhaarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya. (Bukhari: 4940)"
